  "title": "The \"bladeless\" fan has a *secret* 🌀",
  "pronounce": {},
  "aspect": "1:1",
  "gap": 0.05,
  "hook": {
    "lines": [
      "This fan has *no blades*…",
      "so where's the wind coming from?"
    ],
    "clips": [
      "d_ring",
      "d_tissue"
    ],
    "annotate": [
      {
        "type": "arrow",
        "at": 0,
        "until": "line2",
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5,
        "angle": 30
      }
    ],
    "sfx": [
      {
        "id": "boom",
        "at": "word:blades"
      }
    ]
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "lines": [
        "It's Dyson's *Air Multiplier*."
      ],
      "clip": "d_james"
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "The ring is hollow, with a thin *slit*",
        "running all the way around."
      ],
      "clip": "d_ring_anim"
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "Air blasts out of that slit…"
      ],
      "clip": "d_slit"
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "…and the ring's wing-shaped curve",
        "*drags* the room air along with it."
      ],
      "clip": "d_foil"
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "Dyson says that multiplies the airflow",
        "up to *15 times*."
      ],
      "clip": "d_x15",
      "sfx": [
        {
          "id": "ding",
          "at": "word:15"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "No chopping blades",
        "means a smoother breeze…"
      ],
      "clip": "d_plant"
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "…and nothing for little fingers to hit."
      ],
      "clip": "d_kid"
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "But here's the *twist*…"
      ],
      "clip": "d_ring2",
      "pause_after": 0.3,
      "sfx": [
        {
          "id": "dun_dun",
          "at": "start",
          "gain": -5,
          "dur": 2.0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "It *does* have blades."
      ],
      "clip": "d_impeller",
      "punch": true,
      "sfx": [
        {
          "id": "boom",
          "at": "word:does"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "They're hidden in the base —",
        "a motor spins them to suck air in."
      ],
      "clips": [
        "d_cutaway",
        "d_motor"
      ]
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "The \"bladeless\" fan just hides its blades",
        "where you *can't see* them."
      ],
      "clip": "d_james2",
      "sfx": [
        {
          "id": "wait_what",
          "at": "end+0.05"
        }
      ],
      "pause_after": 0.8
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "Did *you* know that? 🌀"
      ],
      "clip": "d_tower"
    }
  ],
